## Outcome and conditions

Calculate a specified index-futures trade and distinguish close-out from held cash settlement and leveraged margin return. Required components: contract_units_and_benchmark, alternative_signed_cashflows, margin_return_and_annualisation_limits. Supported work may use the cited notes; independent checks use no notes, internet, solution or hints. A basic calculator and blank paper are allowed; reasoning, formula selection and assumptions must be supplied by the learner. Numerical examples below are agent-created hypothetical instantiations unless explicitly labelled as a finished-note example. They do not assert current market or policy facts.

